{
  "title": "Ziyarate Hazrat Ali Akbar (a.s.)",
  "data": "اَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا بْنَ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nalssalamu `alayka yabna rasuli allahi\nPeace be upon you, O son of the Messenger of Allah,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَابْنَ نَبِیِّ اللّٰهِ\nalssalamu `alayka yabna nabiyyi allahi\npeace be upon you, O son of the Prophet of Allah,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَابْنَ اَمِیْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayka yabna amiri almu'minina\npeace be upon you, O son of the Commander of the Faithful,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَابْنَ الْحُسَیْنِ الشَّهِیْدِ\nalssalamu `alayka yabna alhusayni alshshahidi\npeace be upon you, O son of al-Husain the martyr,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ اَیُّهَا الشَّهِیْدُ وَابْنُ الشَّهِیْدِ\nalssalamu `alayka ayyuha alshshahidu wabnu alshshahidi\npeace be upon you, O martyr, son of the martyr,\nالسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ اَیُّهَا الْمَظْلُوْمُ وَابْنُ الْمَظْلُوْمِ\nalssalamu `alayka ayyuha almazlumu wabnu almazlumi\npeace be upon you, O the wronged one, son of the wronged one.\nلَعَنَ اللّٰهُ اُمَّۃً قَتَلَتْكَ \nla`ana allahu ummatan qatalatka\nMay Allah curse the nation that killed you,\nوَلَعَنَ اللّٰهُ اُمَّۃً ظَلَمَتْكَ \nwa la`ana allahu ummatan zalamatka\nand may Allah curse the nation that wronged you,\nوَلَعَنَ اللّٰهُ اُمَّۃً سَمِعَتْ بِذَالِكَ فَرَضِیَتِ بِهٖ۔\nwa la`ana allahu ummatan sami`at bidhalika faradiyat bihi\nand may Allah curse the nation that heard of that and was pleased with it."
}
